# counter harness. One force call is one ASE calculate inside lanczos_atoms.
# TSASE 1.0 (98aac60). rotationMax is the problem cap. phi_tol, dR, ss, maxStep, and the initial mode stay at the class defaults.
# The loop stops at absolute overlap 0.99 with the reference mode, at rotationMax 10000, or at the Krylov dimension.
# numpy.random.seed(0) pins vrand.
